urname>Burgaud</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Carter</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Baserga</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Glazer</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Insulin-like growth factor-1 receptor overexpression mediates cellular radioresistance and local breast cancer recurrence after lumpectomy and radiation</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1997</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>3079</fpage><lpage>3083</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9242428</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reinmuth</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Fan</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Jung</surname><given-names>YD</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahmad</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Stoeltzing</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Bucana</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Radinsky</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellis</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Blockade of insulin-like growth factor I receptor function inhibits growth and angiogenesis of colon cancer</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>3259</fpage><lpage>3269</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12374697</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tennant</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Trasher</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Twomey</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Drivdahl</surname><given-names>RH</given